              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoniya olw'okutya Solomoni, yaasituka, yaaja yeegema ku bintu ebiri ng'oti mayiga ga nsolo ebiri ku alutaari, mu Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
