            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakobera Solomoni bati: “Bona, Adoniya akutiire iwe kyabazinga Solomoni, era wuule yeegemye ku bintu ebiri ng'oti mayiga ga nsolo ebiri ku alutaari, ng'akoba ati, ‘Kyabazinga Solomoni asooke andayirire, nga taidha kundhita nze omugheereza we.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
