              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Solomoni yaatuma abantu, baaja baatoola Adoniya ku alutaari. Adoniya yaidha mu maiso ga kyabazinga Solomoni, yaakuba amakiryaivu era yaakutama n'ekyeni kyatuuka ku itaka. Agho kyabazinga Solomoni yaamukoba ati: “Irayo ewuwo.”",
